stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> WAITING_BLINK1

    WAITING_BLINK1 --> IN_BLINK1 : EAR < θc (0.20)
    IN_BLINK1 --> WAITING_BLINK1 : EAR ≥ θo AND frames < fmin\n[rejected — too short]
    IN_BLINK1 --> WAITING_OPEN1  : EAR ≥ θo AND frames ≥ fmin(3)\nrecord t₁

    WAITING_OPEN1  --> WAITING_BLINK2 : open frames ≥ fopen(3)
    WAITING_OPEN1  --> WAITING_OPEN1  : EAR < θc [still closing]

    WAITING_BLINK2 --> WAITING_BLINK1 : now − t₁ > Tw (1800 ms)\n[timeout]
    WAITING_BLINK2 --> IN_BLINK2      : EAR < θc

    IN_BLINK2 --> WAITING_BLINK1 : EAR ≥ θo AND (frames < fmin OR Δt > Tw)\n[rejected]
    IN_BLINK2 --> DONE           : EAR ≥ θo AND frames ≥ fmin AND Δt ≤ Tw\n🔥 FIRE + 4 s cooldown

    DONE --> WAITING_BLINK1 : reset after cooldown
